      ],
      "rationale": "Jayce is popular but losing in global solo queue (49.3% WR at 5.9% PR), while pro presence is already high (41%), so we want to help his laning without adding late-game or coordinated power. We're buffing Hammer Q (To the Skies) base damage at early ranks (60/110/160/210/260 \u2192 72/125/175/222/266). Max rank stays at 310. This makes his early trades and all-ins stronger, but by full build he does almost exactly the same damage, so pro play gains nothing. Sim: soloq_index +0.95% (target +0.5% to +3%), pro_index -0.05% (target \u2264 +1%). The single 'too strong' complaint goes against the data and the diagnosis, so we didn't act on it."
     }
    }
